1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,180
W: I'm getting a lift with Ms. Wilson tonight to go to Steve's housewarming party.

2
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,740
How are you getting there?

3
00:00:05,955 --> 00:00:10,100
M: I was going to drive there, but my car conked out on me this morning on the way to work.

4
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:14,540
I ended up towing my car into a garage, and I had to take the bus to work.

5
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:17,880
Do you think it's possible for me to get a ride with you tonight?

6
00:00:18,705 --> 00:00:22,500
W: I'm sure that it will be fine, but I'll ask Ms. Wilson to make sure.

7
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,965
She's in a meeting now, so I'll ask her when she comes out.

8
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,780
I'll let you know during lunch.

9
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:28,700
M: All right.

10
00:00:29,035 --> 00:00:30,760
I will see you at the cafeteria then.
